Files under `data/` are generated by `pnpm data` from the sources below. They contain only names,
numbers, and identifiers needed for calculation (base stats, types, learnsets, move power and accuracy,
type effectiveness, natures). Official text such as Pokédex entries and move or ability descriptions is
intentionally not included. All rights to the underlying game data remain with their respective owners.

